        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47.\r\rYour primary target is Emma Carlisle, for the Murder Zachary Carlisle and for the attempted murder of Alexa Carlisle.\r\rAs well as Samuel Taylor and Annabel Jones. Their permanent public displays of affection in the hallways during the work hours set a terrible example for the rest of the staff.\r\rTo avoid unnecessary panic, you should make it look like an accident if possible. \r\rGood Luck 47.",
